mgr/nfs: add Server_Addrs support for export fencing

Fixes:https://tracker.ceph.com/issues/80819
Signed-off-by: Pooja Dwivedi pooja.dwivedi@ibm.com

### Description
When a user applied an export config containing Server_Addrs (used for destination IP filtering in Virtual Server setups), Ceph silently dropped the field because the Export model had no support for it. 
This  PR adds server_addrs support across the export lifecycle — parsing, storage, and CLI — so fencing works as expected.

### Testing logs
