72189.body:
Add lightweight diagnostics for the cephadm agent metadata path to help investigate agent-down issues at scale.

The new instrumentation tracks:

- agent metadata request latency;
- `set_store()` latency/counts for host, device and agent state;
- request-path vs background persistence;
- Cheroot worker-pool idle/queue state;
- agent report shape;
- agent ACK fan-out events.

It also adds:

```text
ceph cephadm agent-stats
ceph cephadm agent-stats --format json-pretty
ceph cephadm agent-stats reset
```

Slow agent metadata requests are logged with their per-request persistence breakdown, using DEBUG for requests over 1s and INFO for requests over 5s.

This is diagnostic-only and does not change agent behavior, persistence semantics, HTTP worker counts.

